OL,3,GNEWSACollege may need to return #5m
OL,4,Aafter investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Sheffield College could be forced
OL,7,Fto pay back #5m amid an investigation
OL,8,Finto allegations of maladministration.
OL,10,FAn external audit is under way looking
OL,11,Finto the college's provision for people
OL,12,Flearning English as a foreign language.
OL,14,FSouth Yorkshire Mayoral Combined
OL,15,FAuthority (SYMCA) provides #11.6m each
OL,16,Fyear for adult skills at the college
OL,17,Fand launched an investigation last year
OL,18,Finto potential fraud after it was
OL,19,Fflagged up by auditors, however no
OL,20,Ffraud has been found at this time.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
