OL,3,GNEWSACollege may need to return #5m
OL,4,Aafter investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA college spokesperson said: "Money has
OL,7,Fbeen put aside as a contingency measure
OL,8,Fshould the college be required to repay
OL,9,Fany adult skills funding on conclusion
OL,10,Fof an ongoing external audit.
